From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hendra Manudinata <manoedinata@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 12:25:36 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 060/105] power: supply: s2mpu06: port the remaining fuel gauge
 features

Capacity scaling with the dynamic 100 % at the end of a charge, one-percent
stepping and the guard against rising while discharging; the low-battery
alert (threshold, interrupt and capacity level) and the vendor's power-off
rule as the critical capacity level; averaged voltage and current; and the
ageing steps, selected by a cycle count that userspace provides, which set
the charger's float voltage and reload the gauge's cell data at full charge.
The charger gets the charge-behaviour control the reload needs.

Signed-off-by: Hendra Manudinata <manoedinata@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit 88e49f36836510fa95cb8af009554098acd3d21f)
---
